{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e11-scene-11",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "在幸福面前何必考虑人事压力  (Why Weigh Office Politics Against Happiness?)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "xingzi": "杏子",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "xin_huimei": "辛惠美"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Finding a heartbroken Bu Xiaogu nursing a beer alone after work, Xingzi gently coaxes out the truth of how deeply she loves Chun Yuqiao and urges her to confess openly—sending Xiaogu straight to Yuqiao's apartment door. Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "离开学校半年就学会喝闷酒了？听说你找男朋友了，超级富二代。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "杏子姐，你别给我瞎添乱了，你逗我呢，怎么可能！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "有什么不可能，除非心里有喜欢的人了。你对老大是认真的吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我是因为他才来到咱们公司的。我生活里的每一天，全部都是他。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我觉得我跟他离得好远，他跟我说一句话，我脑子就直接充血，使劲转不停。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "我们很明白，老大能有喜欢的人，是件很不容易的事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "既然爱一个人，你就应该自己去打开他、明白他。去表白吧，敢吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我敢啊！可是雷总说了，如果我靠近他的话，就会给他造成麻烦。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你来这儿大半年了，在幸福面前，何必考虑什么人事压力？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你把他家地址告诉我，这件事跟工作毫无关系，我要明明白白地跟他说！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "工作要汇报？他已经下班了，给他留一点私人空间好吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "不好意思。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "离开学校半年就学会喝闷酒了？听说你找男朋友了，超级富二代。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Barely half a year out of school and already drinking alone? Word is you found a super-rich boyfriend.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "杏子姐，你别给我瞎添乱了，你逗我呢，怎么可能！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xingzi, please don't add to the mess — you must be teasing me, how could that be!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "有什么不可能，除非心里有喜欢的人了。你对老大是认真的吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Why would it be impossible — unless someone else is already in your heart? Are you serious about our boss?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我是因为他才来到咱们公司的。我生活里的每一天，全部都是他。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He is the sole reason I came to our company. Every single day of my life revolves around him.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我觉得我跟他离得好远，他跟我说一句话，我脑子就直接充血，使劲转不停。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yet he feels so far away — when he speaks one sentence to me, the blood rushes to my head and my mind spins!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "我们很明白，老大能有喜欢的人，是件很不容易的事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Kaiwen and I understand better than anyone how rare it is for our boss to care for someone again.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "既然爱一个人，你就应该自己去打开他、明白他。去表白吧，敢吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If you love someone, go open his heart and understand him yourself. Confess to him — do you dare?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我敢啊！可是雷总说了，如果我靠近他的话，就会给他造成麻烦。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I do dare! Only HR warned me that getting close to him will bring trouble down on him.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你来这儿大半年了，在幸福面前，何必考虑什么人事压力？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You've worked here over half a year amid constant gossip — in the face of happiness, why worry about office politics?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你把他家地址告诉我，这件事跟工作毫无关系，我要明明白白地跟他说！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Give me his home address! This has nothing to do with work — I'm going to tell him clearly!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "工作要汇报？他已经下班了，给他留一点私人空间好吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Here to report on work? He is already off duty — could you leave him a little private space?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "不好意思。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I'm sorry to intrude.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "离开学校半年就学会喝闷酒了？听说你找男朋友了，超级富二代。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
